  triage:correctionNote "quality-mgr (2026-07-27): QA-1 for PR #668 (fix/phase-ai-rbp-boundary-cleanup @ de438f19). SCB_CONFIG_GENERIC_HELPER_PATTERNS in .just/lint_boundaries.py (lines 175-180) now targets the real duplicated symbol load_workspace_config in all 4 pattern variants (was previously targeting the nonexistent load_team_config). Exercised by fixture test test_collect_boundary_violations_rejects_scb_config_rule_family in .just/tests/test_lint_boundaries.py. rust-qa-agent additionally confirmed via a live run of .just/lint_boundaries.py against the real repo (boundaries passed). All 6 QA-1 reviewers independently confirmed. CI green 8/8 legs." .